  "details": "Currently, one big issue with using avatar to avatar velocity contacts is that a lot of activations are accidental, typically because someone stick-walked through you to go on the other side of a room.\n\nWhile we can filter out our own velocity (VelocityMagnitude) I wish there would be a way to recover this for triggered contacts too (maybe a tickbox (contactname_Magnitude), this way, a punching minigame for example, would only trigger when the user is actually swinging their hands, and not just \"moving\" around with their thumbstick.",
